# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Editor and tooling state that belongs to a machine, not to the project.
# `.mimosa` is a scanner's history and `.zcodeignore` mirrors this file for one
# editor's file listing; neither is part of the app.
.zcodeignore
.mimosa/
